# Evalite runs with this directory as its cwd (see `evalite.config.ts`), and
# both evalite and Vitest write their caches under `<cwd>/node_modules`:
# `node_modules/.evalite/cache.sqlite` (evalite's run storage) and
# `node_modules/.vite` (Vitest's transform cache). The repo-root .gitignore
# only ignores the rooted `/node_modules`, so this nested one needs its own.
node_modules/

# `pnpm eval:matrix` writes its run to `evals/corvus-matrix.json`
# (`--outputPath`, resolved against evalite's cwd). That file is a snapshot of
# one manual, keyed run — the numbers belong in the #82 comment, not in the
# tree, where they would rot into a stale claim about two models.
corvus-matrix.json
